      "question": "The assembly instructions for the desk must be written very ---- to ensure that customers understand them.",
      "choices": [
        "clearer",
        "clearest",
        "clears",
        "clearly"
      ],
      "answer": "D",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "topic": "词性辨析",
      "keywords": "adverb clearly instructions",
      "answer_explain": "空格修饰 written，说明写作方式，需要副词 clearly；very 进一步修饰 clearly 的程度。clearer 和 clearest 是形容词的比较级、最高级；clears 是动词第三人称单数，均不适用。",
      "question_type": "语法题",
      "choice_translations": [
        "更清楚的",
